From: aker1305 <aker1305@gmail.com>
Date: Fri, 6 Nov 2026 13:48:15 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 1/6] Add spoken set/round announcements (Spanish TTS)

At the start of each work interval the app says the current serie
(block repetition) and tanda (work interval inside the serie), e.g.
"Serie 2 de 4. Tanda 3 de 8." Breaks between series announce the next
serie. Uses flutter_tts with the same volume as the timer sounds.

- New voice/ module: pure announcement builder + TTS announcer
- RunTimer triggers announcements when the current interval changes
- Settings: "Voice announcements" switch (stored in SharedPreferences)
- Android: TTS_SERVICE <queries> entry required on Android 11+
- Unit tests for the announcement builder

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
